node observed | Observed data | assignment and outcomes
node score | Centered score | neighborhood monomials | Bernoulli contrasts
node snipe-average | SNIPE average | score-weighted outcomes | up to β̄_d
node clipped | Clipped estimate | natural bounded range
node target | Total-effect target
node question | Worst-case MSE | best possible?
edge observed -> score
edge observed -> snipe-average
edge score -> snipe-average
edge snipe-average -> clipped
edge clipped -> question
